The particle identification cut efficiency (\(\varepsilon_{PID}\)) includes two components: the TOF velocity (\(1/\beta\)) cut efficiency and \(dE/dx\) cut (\(n\sigma_{K/\pi}\)) efficiency. They are also discussed before in the section 4.3.4 and 3.5.4.

